## Workshop API

The Workshop module provides a lightweight in‑memory store for user stories collected during workshops.

### Endpoints

| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/workshop/stories` | Returns the list of all stored stories. |
| `POST` | `/api/workshop/stories` | Creates a new story. Body must match `StoryCreate` (no `story_id`). Returns the created `Story` with generated `story_id`. |
| `POST` | `/api/workshop/review` | Sends a review request for the supplied story IDs. Payload: `{ "story_ids": [1,2,3] }`. Returns `{ "status": "review_sent" }`. |

All request and response payloads use **snake_case** JSON keys.

